    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Khalid Samad built a public life around youth empowerment, violence prevention, and community safety in Cleveland. He served in city and school-system gang-intervention roles, co-founded Coalition for a Better Life, known as Peace in the Hood, and became a national voice on urban peace, justice, and neighborhood leadership."
    ]
